{"clause": "3.3.3", "title": "영업의 양도 등에 따른 개인정보 이전", "controls": [], "standalone": true, "responsibility_hint": "org", "notes": "Transfer of personal data on sale of a business. Statutory, with no control counterpart."}
{"clause": "3.3.4", "title": "개인정보 국외이전", "controls": [], "standalone": true, "responsibility_hint": "org", "notes": "Cross-border transfer. The derivation flags the storage/user region mismatch; the legal test is PIPA's and is not made here."}
